<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Treasury announces OLO auction details.</title>
<headline>Belgian Treasury announces OLO auction details.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury on Tuesday said it would offer the following OLO lines at exchange auctions to be held this month.</p>
<p>January 14: Treasury offering OLO lines 13 (7.00 pct, April 1999), 10 (8.75 pct, June 2002), 19 (6.50 pct, March 2005) and 24 (7.00 pct, May 2006) against OLO lines 15 (6.75 pct, May 1997) and 8 (9.25 pct, Aug 1997).</p>
<p>January 21: Treasury offering OLO lines 11 (9.00 pct, July 1998), 7 (9.00 pct, June 2001), 10 (8.75 pct, June 2002), 19 (6.50 pct, March 2005) and 24 (7.00 pct, May 2006) against OLO line 4 (9.25 pct, Jan 1998).</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
